# Default output directory for `python train.py`.
#
# Produced logs are not tracked here: the canonical copies of the article's logs
# live in ../../grokking_analysis/grokking_logs/, next to the code that reads
# them. Train straight into that directory when you mean to refresh them:
#
#     python train.py --article --outdir ../grokking_analysis/grokking_logs
*.csv
